    },
    {
      "id": "nA4BGfsSal7D9bRXQZXOw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 274.2867658551543,
      "y": 172.24300426336544,
      "width": 703.9990844726562,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1607753301,
      "version": 771,
      "versionNonce": 1789041607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787478776933,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Platform to book tickets\n\nFunctional Requirements (Dump down the application requirements)\n- search events in a particular city\n- book ticket\n- download ticket\n\n== out of scope ==\n- Admin be able to add/remove/update evens\n- Show trending/popular events\n- User be able to view bookings\n- User pay for the booking\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Consistency > Availability for ticket booking\n- 100M DAU\n- 1B ticket booking\n\n\nEntities\n- users\n- events\n- tickets",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Platform to book tickets\n\nFunctional Requirements (Dump down the application requirements)\n- search events in a particular city\n- book ticket\n- download ticket\n\n== out of scope ==\n- Admin be able to add/remove/update evens\n- Show trending/popular events\n- User be able to view bookings\n- User pay for the booking\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Consistency > Availability for ticket booking\n- 100M DAU\n- 1B ticket booking\n\n\nEntities\n- users\n- events\n- tickets",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OsuS5uJP0Zc7x74sgIlvk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1073.7647811590055,
      "y": 204.1215901836369,
      "width": 461.9993896484375,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1794356231,
      "version": 430,
      "versionNonce": 828148649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787477408610,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API's\n\n- Get events\nendpoint - GET: /events?city=\"bangalore\"\nresult - events[]\n\n- book ticket\nendpoint - POST: /events/:eventId\nbody: { count: number }\nresponse: 201 status code for succes \n\n- Download tickets\nendpoints - GET: /events/tickets/:ticketId\nresponse: ticket\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API's\n\n- Get events\nendpoint - GET: /events?city=\"bangalore\"\nresult - events[]\n\n- book ticket\nendpoint - POST: /events/:eventId\nbody: { count: number }\nresponse: 201 status code for succes \n\n- Download tickets\nendpoints - GET: /events/tickets/:ticketId\nresponse: ticket\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
